# ROVEXO Absolute Owner Design Lock

**STATUS: MANDATORY | OWNER AUTHORITY | NEVER OVERRIDE**

The Owner has absolute authority. Only the Owner may: Approve · Modify · Freeze · Certify · Authorize Implementation · Authorize Deployments · Authorize Production.

## Cursor must never decide (without Owner approval)

- A page is approved
- A page is finished / complete
- A page is frozen
- A page is certified
- A page is production ready

## One Page Rule

Only **one page** may be developed at a time.

Flow (mandatory, no skipping):

1. Images (local only)
2. Visual review
3. Modifications (if Owner requests)
4. Owner approval
5. Design Lock
6. Implementation
7. Typecheck · ESLint · Build · Playwright · QA
8. Owner approval
9. Freeze
10. Owner approval
11. Certification
12. Owner approval
13. Next page

Forbidden: multi-page batches, complete modules, skipping any gate.

## Image Generation Mode (READ ONLY)

**Allowed:** SVG · PNG · JPG · local HTML previews · local galleries

**Forbidden:** Deploy · Commit · Push · Implementation · Production changes · GitHub Actions · Vercel deployments · Alias changes

Previews remain **local**. Wait for Owner visual approval.

## Current page (until Owner advances)

**PROFILE PAGE (MAIN)** — including Profile Header, Favourites, Balance, My Orders, Holiday Mode, Settings, Rovexo Ideas, Help Centre, Legal Information, Sign Out.

## Profile UI contract (visual)

- Device: iPhone 17 Pro Max · mobile first · full width 100%
- White · purple accent · black icons · black text
- Menu rows: 56px · 16px Regular (400)
- Header: Avatar 64px · username · View Profile · review score
- Rating examples: `5.0 ⭐ (55)` · empty: `New member` or `No reviews yet`
- Bottom nav: Home · Search · Sell · Inbox · Profile
- Legal: Privacy · Terms · Cookies · Platform Rules · About ROVEXO · Contact Us

## Platform Fee display

- Show: `incl. 🛡`
- Never show: `5.5%` or Platform Fee %
- Info: Platform Fee helps maintain ROVEXO, supports secure payments, buyer and seller protection, platform maintenance, customer support and future improvements.

## Final rule

No code before: Images → Visual review → Owner approval → Design Lock.

After Design Lock only: Implementation → gates → Owner approvals → Freeze → Certification → Production.

Wait for Owner approval before every phase.
